# Line endings are a property of this repo, not of the machine that cloned it. A Windows
# clone (core.autocrlf defaults to true there, including on the GitHub Actions windows
# runners) would otherwise check every file out as CRLF - and the pinning tests that read
# packaging/displayrotate.nsi line by line would see a different file on each OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch is CRLF's native habitat - a label or goto can misbehave with bare LF.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Never munge these.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
